flowchart LR
  %% Command-workflow overview; handler nodes are methods of ComponentHandlers.
  %% Solid arrows: local calls/data access. Dashed arrows: queued event publication/dispatch.
  UI[ScreenController] -->|submit / poll / query| GW[EventGateway]
  GW -->|read-only queries| QUERY[QueryService]
  GW -->|poll receipts| STATUS[OperationStatusStore]
  GW -.->|enqueue command| BUS["InProcessBus: in-memory FIFO<br/>one worker; sequential subscribers"]
  BUS -.-> AUTH[Accounts / campaigns / profiles handlers]
  BUS -.-> ADMIT[Gameplay admission]
  ADMIT -.->|context prepared| BUS
  BUS -.-> PLAN[Director model]
  PLAN -.->|plan proposed| BUS
  BUS -.-> VALIDATE[Validation / disclosure / projection]
  VALIDATE -.->|narration work ready| BUS
  BUS -.-> NARRATE["Narrator handler<br/>provider receives PlayerView only"]
  NARRATE -.->|narration proposed| BUS
  BUS -.-> COMMIT[Persistence handler]
  COMMIT -->|GameplayService / atomic commit| SQL[SQLiteStore + pending notices]
  COMMIT -.->|turn committed IDs| BUS
  BUS -.-> RESULT[Result subscriber]
  BUS -.-> REPORT[Separately registered report subscriber]
  RECOVER[CompletionRecovery] -->|read committed notices| SQL
  RECOVER -.->|committed notice IDs only| BUS
  AUTH & ADMIT & PLAN & VALIDATE & NARRATE & COMMIT & REPORT --> SHARED[Shared domain capabilities / adapters]
  BUS -.-> EDIT_PREP[Editor prepare and capture]
  EDIT_PREP -.->|EDITOR_CONTEXT reference| BUS
  BUS -.-> EDIT_AI[Editor proposal model]
  EDIT_AI -.->|EDITOR_CANDIDATE reference| BUS
  BUS -.-> EDIT_RETAIN[Editor proposal retention]
  EDIT_RETAIN -->|EditorService| EDIT_STORE[SQLite proposal repository]
  EDIT_PREP & EDIT_AI & EDIT_RETAIN --> SHARED
  %% Both application bootstraps fail interrupted attempts before accepting requests; no provider replay.
